## Hygen 模板引擎

**Hygen** 使用文件系统中的模板目录，无需配置文件：

```
_templates/
├── package/
│   └── new/
│       ├── prompt.js
│       ├── package.json.ejs.t
│       ├── tsconfig.json.ejs.t
│       ├── src/
│       │   └── index.ts.ejs.t
│       └── vitest.config.ts.ejs.t
└── component/
    └── new/
        ├── prompt.js
        └── component.tsx.ejs.t
```

```javascript
// _templates/package/new/prompt.js
module.exports = [
  {
    type: 'input',
    name: 'name',
    message: 'Package name:',
  },
  {
    type: 'select',
    name: 'type',
    message: 'Package type:',
    choices: ['library', 'config', 'types'],
  },
];
```

```ejs
---
to: packages/<%= name %>/package.json
---
{
  "name": "@myorg/<%= name %>",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./src/index.ts",
      "default": "./src/index.ts"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsup",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@myorg/tsconfig": "workspace:*",
    "typescript": "^5.7.0"
  }
}
```

```bash
# 使用 Hygen 生成新包
npx hygen package new
```

